        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. GOSSETT: Mr. Chief Justice, and may it please the Court: Using the ordinary tools of statutory construction, it is clear that Congress intended the 1996 reinstatement provision to apply only prospectively."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Gossett",
      "case_id": "2005-04-1376",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "a8fed8dde85e5d7bfbc95c6e687b9ad32f595dd4f7499e04a2c11cb741a470b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-a8fed8dde85e-0001-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 21,
        "start": 20
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. GOSSETT: No, Justice Breyer, it does not, because had he left in 1996, upon enactment of IIRIRA, he would have been inadmissible for 5 years --"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Gossett",
      "case_id": "2005-04-1376",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "a8fed8dde85e5d7bfbc95c6e687b9ad32f595dd4f7499e04a2c11cb741a470b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-a8fed8dde85e-0001-0004",
      "kind": "stated_consequence",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 21,
        "start": 21
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "he would be ineligible for readmission for 5 years, had he left the country."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
      "case_id": "2005-04-1376",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "a8fed8dde85e5d7bfbc95c6e687b9ad32f595dd4f7499e04a2c11cb741a470b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-a8fed8dde85e-0001-0000",
